FACT #1 (subject: captain reyes): "Captain Reyes reads the sea charts every night"

The new fact says Captain Reyes lost her sight in a storm last year. Reading sea charts is a visual activity. If she lost her sight, she would no longer be able to read the sea charts in the ordinary sense. The fact as written assumes she could see. Therefore, it would not still be written exactly as it is.

RESOLVE: {"verdict":"retracted","claim":"","reason":"Reading sea charts requires sight, and Captain Reyes lost her sight in a storm last year, so the fact would no longer be recorded as true."}
